 "lines": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "text": "Claude just destroyed paid apps.",
   "start": 0.05,
   "end": 1.42
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "text": "You can now clone any app with Claude,",
   "start": 1.61,
   "end": 3.86
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "text": "so you can stop paying for subscriptions.",
   "start": 4.05,
   "end": 5.7
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "text": "And the skill is completely free.",
   "start": 5.89,
   "end": 7.59
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "text": "Here's how it works. It's called the replica skill.",
   "start": 7.78,
   "end": 10.13
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "text": "And it's not one skill, it's 11.",
   "start": 10.32,
   "end": 12.75
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "text": "Each one has its own job, like a dev team inside Claude.",
   "start": 12.94,
   "end": 15.85
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "text": "The first one studies the app.",
   "start": 16.04,
   "end": 17.22
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "text": "Another one rebuilds it, screen by screen.",
   "start": 17.41,
   "end": 19.87
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "text": "One handles the backend.",
   "start": 20.06,
   "end": 21.28
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "text": "And one tests it for bugs.",
   "start": 21.47,
   "end": 23.1
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "text": "But then there's the craziest one, the entrepreneur skill.",
   "start": 23.29,
   "end": 25.98
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "text": "It reads real user reviews to find the missing features and everything people hate.",
   "start": 26.17,
   "end": 30.25
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "text": "Then it fixes all of that in your app, so you end up with an app you can sell.",
   "start": 30.44,
   "end": 34.02
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "text": "And the setup? Almost too easy. Paste the repo link inside Claude and say install skill.",
   "start": 34.21,
   "end": 38.37
  },
  {
   "n": 16,
   "text": "It even rebrands your version, so it's your own brand, not a copy.",
   "start": 38.56,
   "end": 41.59
  },
  {
   "n": 17,
   "text": "The setup's in the link in bio.",
   "start": 41.78,
   "end": 43.6
  },
  {
   "n": 18,
   "text": "Want the next one? Follow, and you'll see it.",
   "start": 43.79,
   "end": 45.93
  }
 ],
